S1EN←('If anyone wants to ask and would like to know whom the monarch could rely on in this matter,' 'The drifting sand is tamed, at the command of Kings Frederik and Christian,') ('then Amtmand Gram has never let his eye rest,' 'by the faithful diligence of Amtmand Frederik von Gram') ('and Røhl, as is well deserved, has been rewarded for his toil.' 'and the practised hand of Røhl. 1738.')
